---
import InfoPageLayout from '../../layouts/InfoPageLayout.astro';
import { MAINTAINER, AUTHOR, PROFESSIONAL_REVIEWS } from '../../lib/editorial';
import { SITE } from '../../../site.config';
const schema = [{ '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'ProfilePage',
  name: 'AyTool maintainer and publishing responsibility', url: `${SITE.url}${MAINTAINER.path}`,
  mainEntity: { ...AUTHOR, description: MAINTAINER.role } }];
---
<InfoPageLayout title="AyTool Maintainer – Who Prepares and Updates This Site"
  description="Who maintains AyTool, what the public byline means, how sources and code are checked, and the status of independent professional review."
  path={MAINTAINER.path} h1="AyTool Maintainer" schema={schema}>
  <p>“AyTool maintainer” is the public role-based byline for the person responsible for developing,
    publishing and correcting this independent website. It does not represent a panel of experts.</p>
  <h2>Work covered by this byline</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Building and maintaining the calculators, exam guides and downloadable datasets.</li>
    <li>Transcribing source-linked schedules and rules, with recorded verification dates where available.</li>
    <li>Maintaining calculation tests, links and public corrections.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The <a href="https://github.com/jiayibyte/ph_sss">public project repository</a> provides the source
    code and revision history. A source link or a passing software test is evidence of that work;
    it is not proof of a professional qualification.</p>
  <h2>Professional review and qualifications</h2>
  <p>No nursing, accountancy, tax-adviser or other regulated professional qualification is claimed
    by this byline. {PROFESSIONAL_REVIEWS.length === 0 ? 'No completed independent professional reviews are registered at present.' : 'Completed professional reviews are identified on the pages they cover.'}
    When a qualified reviewer completes a review and agrees to be named, the relevant page will
    show their public background, the material reviewed, review date and evidence of the review.</p>
  <h2>How the site is prepared</h2>
  <p>AI tools assist with software development and draft wording. Official notices, source data
    and cited rules remain the basis for factual statements. Calculations use versioned data and
    shared calculation functions. Automated checks are separate from independent professional review.</p>
  <p>Read the <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial and review policy</a>,
    <a href="/methodology/">calculation methodology</a> and <a href="/corrections/">public correction log</a>.</p>
  <h2>Contact and accountability</h2>
  <p>Send a page URL, the statement in question and a primary source to
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>. Useful corrections are checked
    against the source and material changes are recorded publicly. Contact details do not imply
    affiliation with PRC or another government agency.</p>
</InfoPageLayout>
